01:24:15.510 --> 01:24:16.470
<v Markus>Eine Octo-Cat.

01:24:17.430 --> 01:24:18.550
<v Ingo>Oh Gott.

01:24:19.830 --> 01:24:20.390
<v Ingo>Oh Mann.

01:24:20.630 --> 01:24:24.870
