01:35:46.310 --> 01:35:46.950
<v Markus>Sondern Hack.

01:35:50.870 --> 01:35:52.550
<v Markus>Das Kommando, neben das Hugo.

01:35:52.790 --> 01:35:55.750
<v Markus>MG HG, das Kommando.

01:35:57.350 --> 01:35:57.910
<v Markus>Mercurical.

01:35:58.150 --> 01:35:58.710
<v Markus>Macuricle.

01:35:58.950 --> 01:35:59.110
<v Markus>Genau.

01:36:01.190 --> 01:36:02.630
<v Ingo>Deswegen sage ich ja Bitbucket.

01:36:03.030 --> 01:36:03.750
<v Ingo>Also das war.

01:36:04.230 --> 01:36:06.790
<v Markus>Ja, Bitbucket kann Git und Mercurical, ja.

01:36:07.110 --> 01:36:09.990
<v Ingo>Ja, und früher konnten sie nur das andere.

01:36:10.390 --> 01:36:13.430
